Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.53,0:00:00.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.80,0:00:01.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,I want to show
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.19,0:00:01.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,you something I've been
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.79,0:00:02.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,working on.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.80,0:00:03.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,It's an interactive Koi
Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.92,0:00:05.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,Fish wallpaper.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:09.40,0:00:10.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,Just click anywhere on
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.28,0:00:11.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,the water to drop
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.06,0:00:12.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,some fish food,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.29,0:00:12.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,and watch the koi
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.98,0:00:14.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,swim towards it and
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.11,0:00:15.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,start eating.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.12,0:00:16.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,If the food lands
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.01,0:00:17.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,on a lotus leaf,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.36,0:00:19.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,the leaves actually move
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.23,0:00:20.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,and react to it.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.57,0:00:21.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,I've also added a
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.33,0:00:22.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,lot of little details
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.52,0:00:23.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,to make the pond
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.40,0:00:24.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,feel alive:
Dialogue: 2,0:00:24.68,0:00:26.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,realistic water ripples,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:26.21,0:00:27.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,tiny air bubbles,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:27.59,0:00:28.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,soft shadows from the
Dialogue: 2,0:00:28.62,0:00:29.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,lotus flowers,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.71,0:00:30.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,and much more.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.87,0:00:31.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,You can customize the
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.69,0:00:33.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,experience, too.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.26,0:00:33.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,Change the number of
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.97,0:00:35.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,fish in the pond,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:35.33,0:00:36.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,adjust the frame rate
Dialogue: 2,0:00:36.20,0:00:38.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,up to 144 FPS,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.53,0:00:39.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,and choose the rendering
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.45,0:00:40.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,quality,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.17,0:00:40.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,from low all the
Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.91,0:00:42.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,way up to Ultra.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:42.29,0:00:42.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,But this is just
Dialogue: 2,0:00:42.97,0:00:43.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,the beginning.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:44.17,0:00:45.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking of adding
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.13,0:00:46.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,a day-and-night cycle,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:46.50,0:00:47.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,so you can experience
Dialogue: 2,0:00:47.36,0:00:49.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,the pond under moonlight,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.03,0:00:49.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,along with a rainy
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.89,0:00:50.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,weather effect,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.88,0:00:52.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,where raindrops create
Dialogue: 2,0:00:52.13,0:00:53.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,ripples across the water.
